,"source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2024","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/xml-data/corpfiling/AttachHis/2937051f-7c56-4a37-8d0d-d19a7960ef4a.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2023","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/xml-data/corpfiling/AttachHis/a02f5df4-5a85-49d0-bd50-c0d544679658.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2022","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/532805/73475532805.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2021","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/532805/69043532805.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2020","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/532805/5328050320.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2019","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/532805/5328050319.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2018","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/532805/5328050318.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2017","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/532805/5328050317.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2016","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/532805/5328050316.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2015","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/532805/5328050315.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2014","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/532805/5328050314.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2013","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/532805/5328050313.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2012","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/532805/5328050312.pdf","source":"bse"}],"analysis":{"summary":"Redington reported its highest-ever quarterly revenue and profit after tax in Q2 FY27, driven by strong growth across India and the Middle East despite geopolitical uncertainties and supply chain complexities. Consolidated revenue for the quarter reached INR43,002 crores, up 48% year-on-year, while profit after tax excluding exceptional items rose 50% to INR581 crores. Growth was broad-based, with standout performances in Technology Solutions Group (TSG) and Software Solutions Group (SSG), supported by AI server demand and high average selling prices. Meanwhile, the Turkey subsidiary Arena faced continued challenges, resulting in business and transition losses and an impairment charge. Redington reported its financial results for Q2 and H1 FY27, achieving its highest ever quarterly revenue and PAT globally.","themes":{"guidance":[],"demand_outlook":[{"claim":"Management noted that commercial PCs are flat to showing small growth for now.","quote":"Commercial PCs are flattish to a small growth for now.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=78612866-38a7-4331-8300-205a26f8cf78.pdf"},{"claim":"Management stated that commercial PC demand has not seen minus 10% to minus 20% type demand softening due to price increases.","quote":"We've not seen minus 10%, minus 20% type demand softening on commercial PCs.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=78612866-38a7-4331-8300-205a26f8cf78.pdf"},{"claim":"Management stated that India, GGCL, and Africa will continue to be very strong growth drivers in the second half.","quote":"What you see, I think you'll -- on a geography perspective, I think India, GGCL and Africa will continue to be very strong growth drivers.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=78612866-38a7-4331-8300-205a26f8cf78.pdf"},{"claim":"Management stated that TSG will remain a very strong number one growth driver followed by SSG in the second half.","quote":"So second half, we continue to see TSG being a very strong number 1 in terms of growth driver, followed by SSG.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=78612866-38a7-4331-8300-205a26f8cf78.pdf"},{"claim":"Management noted that ROW demonstrated good performance despite ongoing geo-political challenges.","quote":"ROW demonstrated good performance despite ongoing geo-political challenges","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=3e91043a-22c5-4992-a134-7217e7013de9.pdf"},{"claim":"The data center business and its order backlog and funnel look promising for the coming quarters.","quote":"So definitely, it looks very promising, the data center business and the backlog we have as well as the funnel we have.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=f6e22e14-f609-4a68-a335-762cdab0b85f.pdf"}],"capex_expansion":[{"claim":"ProConnect achieved all-time high quarterly revenues during Q2FY27.","quote":"ProConnect achieved all-time high quarterly revenues","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=3e91043a-22c5-4992-a134-7217e7013de9.pdf"}],"margins_costs":[{"claim":"Management stated that operating expenses increased at a lower rate of 40% while revenue grew 48%.","quote":"We also retained operating leverage revenue grew 48%, while operating expenses increased at a lower rate of 40%.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=78612866-38a7-4331-8300-205a26f8cf78.pdf"},{"claim":"Management stated that opex is expected to track anywhere between INR950 crores to INR1,000 crores a quarter.","quote":"We should track anywhere between INR950 crores to INR1,000 crores a quarter.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=78612866-38a7-4331-8300-205a26f8cf78.pdf"},{"claim":"ProConnect Global reported an EBITDA margin of 11% and PAT at 2% for Q2FY27.","quote":"EBITDA margin at 11% and PAT at 2%","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=3e91043a-22c5-4992-a134-7217e7013de9.pdf"},{"claim":"An impairment of intangibles of ₹ 80.3 Crores was recognized due to challenging economic conditions in Turkey and revised future projections.","quote":"Due to the challenging economic conditions in Turkey and revised future projections, an impairment of intangibles of ₹ 80.3 Crores (₹ 39.7 Cr is Redington Share of Loss) has been recognized and disclosed as an exceptional item in the financial results.","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=3e91043a-22c5-4992-a134-7217e7013de9.pdf"},{"claim":"Pre-war sea shipments converted to air and withdrawn war-related insurance policies increased costs by about $3 million for the quarter.","quote":"Pre-war, almost about 85% of our purchases used to be through sea shipments, which all have got converted into air. So you can imagine the increase in price and also certain war-related insurance policies got withdrawn. So we had to take some additional policies. So a lot of increase in cost, about $3 million for the quarter.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=f6e22e14-f609-4a68-a335-762cdab0b85f.pdf"},{"claim":"Gross margin compression occurred in the existing IT business in Arena.","quote":"And there's also a gross margin compression in the existing IT business now.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=f6e22e14-f609-4a68-a335-762cdab0b85f.pdf"}],"orders_capacity":[{"claim":"Management stated that large deals exceeded INR3,800 crores and accounted for roughly 9% of the group's revenue.","quote":"Large deals exceeded INR3,800 crores and accounted for roughly 9% of the group's revenue.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=78612866-38a7-4331-8300-205a26f8cf78.pdf"},{"claim":"Management stated that excluding large deals, TSG grew by 33%.","quote":"Excluding these large deals, TSG grew by 33%, giving us confidence in the depth of the underlying opportunity.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=78612866-38a7-4331-8300-205a26f8cf78.pdf"},{"claim":"Management stated that large deal contribution from TSG for the current quarter was roughly INR3,800 crores.","quote":"For the current quarter, roughly about INR3,800 crores is our large deal sizes. If you eliminate everything else is BAU.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=78612866-38a7-4331-8300-205a26f8cf78.pdf"},{"claim":"Large deals reached nearly INR1,000 crores during the quarter, with about INR700 crores coming from the India data center category.","quote":"There was a good chunk from large deals of nearly INR1,000 crores during the quarter, most of these being in India, in the data center category, with the visibility of strong deal pipeline for the rest of the year.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=f6e22e14-f609-4a68-a335-762cdab0b85f.pdf"}],"capital_allocation":[{"claim":"Management stated that working capital was at 35 days at the lower end of the 35 to 40 day guidance range.","quote":"Working capital was at 35 days at the lower end of our 35- to 40-day guidance range that we provide every quarter.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=78612866-38a7-4331-8300-205a26f8cf78.pdf"},{"claim":"Global Debt to Equity was reported at 0.55x for Q2FY27.","quote":"Debt to Equity was at 0.55x","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=3e91043a-22c5-4992-a134-7217e7013de9.pdf"},{"claim":"Arena's debt reduced from $120 million to $90 million because of local business exits.","quote":"S.V. Krishnan: From a debt perspective in Arena, what used to be $120 million, $130 million has now come down to $90 million, and that's because of the exits from the local business that we did.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=f6e22e14-f609-4a68-a335-762cdab0b85f.pdf"}],"risks_headwinds":[{"claim":"Management stated that Arena share of the loss this quarter was INR115 crores, which comprises business loss, lira business transition loss, and exceptional impairment of intangibles.","quote":"Redington share of the loss this quarter was INR115 crores. This loss comprises of the business loss and a lira business transition loss and an exceptional impairment of intangibles of INR40 crores.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=78612866-38a7-4331-8300-205a26f8cf78.pdf"},{"claim":"Management stated that supply chains remain under stress in the Middle East due to the closure of the Strait of Hormuz.","quote":"I mean, completely, I mean Strait of Hormuz is closed, and we need to find alternate routes of receiving the material.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=78612866-38a7-4331-8300-205a26f8cf78.pdf"},{"claim":"Arena business revenue decreased by 37% YoY due to exit from Turkish Lira denominated businesses resulting in a loss in the quarter.","quote":"Arena business performance during Q2FY27 : Revenue decreased by 37% YoY due to exit from Turkish Lira denominated businesses resulting in loss in this quarter.","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=3e91043a-22c5-4992-a134-7217e7013de9.pdf"},{"claim":"In the Middle East, geopolitical tensions continued through the entire quarter.","quote":"In Middle East, the geopolitical tensions continued through the entire quarter.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=f6e22e14-f609-4a68-a335-762cdab0b85f.pdf"},{"claim":"Arena recorded a Q1 loss of INR64 crores, with Redington's portion being INR31 crores, driven by lower revenue after exiting the mobility business, Paynet divestment, and gross margin compression.","quote":"From a Q1 perspective, there was a loss of INR64 crores, Redington portion being INR31 crores. The continued losses are due to the lower revenue after exiting the mobility business in Arena and also the divestment of Paynet. And there's also a gross margin compression in the existing IT business now.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=f6e22e14-f609-4a68-a335-762cdab0b85f.pdf"},{"claim":"Supply chain issues cause product delivery delays of up to 30 days in UAE and Saudi Arabia.","quote":"There may be a delay of 30 days, and we're just factoring that in into our overall equation.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=f6e22e14-f609-4a68-a335-762cdab0b85f.pdf"}]},"management_commitments":[{"claim":"Management stated a commitment to make Q3 and the second half a success.","quote":"We are definitely committed to make Q3 and second half a success too.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=78612866-38a7-4331-8300-205a26f8cf78.pdf","timeframe":""},{"claim":"The company aims to make its CloudQuarks platform best-in-class in the next 1 to 2 years.","quote":"And our vision is to be best-in-class in the next 1 to 2 years, and we're putting all our might and investment on this to be best-in-class.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=f6e22e14-f609-4a68-a335-762cdab0b85f.pdf","timeframe":"next 2 years"}],"coverage":{"docs_analysed":3,"kinds":["concall_transcript","concall_ppt"]}},"_meta":{"model":"gemini-3.6-flash","grounded":true,"facts_kept":28,"facts_dropped_ungrounded":8,"note":"Facts are verbatim-grounded against the company's own documents; claims whose quote was not found were dropped."}}